      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784305380840,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So host apne default gateway pr data bhejega aur\nusko kahega ki mujhe pata nhi ye IP kaha pe hai but\nusko ye to pata hai ki wo uske network me nhi hai to\nwo router ko send kar dega then router dekhega ye\njis IP ko bhejna chahta hai wo router k dusre\nnetwork ka part hai to use bhej dega",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So host apne default gateway pr data bhejega aur usko kahega ki mujhe pata nhi ye IP kaha pe hai but usko ye to pata hai ki wo uske network me nhi hai to wo router ko send kar dega then router dekhega ye jis IP ko bhejna chahta hai wo router k dusre network ka part hai to use bhej dega",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
